 * 		fsvr_vnode_flush_object -> fsvr_vnode_pager_flush.
 * 		[92/03/25            roy]
 * 
 * 	Revision 2.13  92/05/01  10:00:42  rabii
 * 		Changed the parameters to fsvr_exec_lookup to return the 
 *		command name and got rid of unused parameters (vtype, vrdev, 
 *		node) (pjg).
 * 
 * Revision 2.14  92/05/01  07:51:03  roman
 * Changes from pjg to make sure u.u_comm is set up correctly when exec is
 * done from a remote node.
 * 
 * Revision 2.13  92/04/06  19:08:45  klh
 * For OSF merge, update version # to match LCC#
 * 
 * Revision 2.12  92/04/05  17:06:58  pjg
 * 	add defn for fsvr_devstat and fsvr_getmntid. Change fsvr_stat and
 * 	fsvr_fstat to use stat_t instead of statb_t              (durriya)
 * 
 * 	Added fsvr_report_migrate(), an RPC used by the emulator to inform
 * 	storage node of pipe or FIFO that a reader has migrated. (chrisp)
 * 
 * Revision 2.11  92/03/20  11:35:26  pjg
 * 	intr_delivery now carries a flag for exit processing (loverso).
 * 
 * Revision 2.10  92/03/15  14:29:41  roy
 * 	Mapped files interfaces moved here from bsd_1.defs.
 * 	Change parameters to release_token.
 * 	Add import of server_mach_msg.h (srl).
 * 	Change copyright (pjg).
 * 	Allow mapping of anon memory to be backed by vnode pager (durriya).
 * 
 * Revision 2.9  92/03/03  13:51:52  pjg
 * 	Add 'flag' parameter in exec_read_* functions.
 * 
 * Revision 2.8  92/03/01  18:38:12  pjg
 * 	Deleted fsvr_vref and fsvr_vrele (pjg).
 * 	Add fsvr_inode_pager_setup_fport and fsvr_vnode_flush_object (durriya).
 * 	Delete signature port and interrupt variable from stubs (loverso).
 * 
 * 	92/02/28  16:52:38  noemi
 * 	Changed all uses of covered vnode ports and file system root ports to
 * 	mount structure ports.
 * 
 * Revision 2.7  92/02/11  21:50:09  pjg
 * 	Change the creds port to MACH_MSG_TYPE_MAKE_SEND for calls initiated
 * 	from exec (roman@locus.com).
 * 
 * Revision 2.6  92/01/17  17:31:26  roy
 * 	Interruptible system call support.
 * 
 * Revision 2.5  92/01/16  17:45:04  roy
 * 	92/01/16  13:30:12  pjg
 * 	Added support for NFS client.
 * 
 * Revision 2.4  92/01/14  11:19:59  roy
 * 	92/01/11  18:48:07  ses
 * 	Added fsvr_vref.
 * 
 * 	92/01/10  21:59:00  noemi
 * 	Changed arguments to fsvr_update_time.
 * 
 * 	92/01/07  16:58:51  noemi
 * 	Added fsvr_getfsstat and fsvr_getfsstat_count.  Added a credentials
 * 	port to fsvr_sync.
 * 
 * 	92/01/06  20:33:36  noemi
 * 	Added fsvr_getfh and fsvr_statfs
 * 
 * Revision 2.3  92/01/09  15:59:59  roy
 * 	Unix domain socket support (loverso).
 * 
 * Revision 2.2  92/01/05  20:21:07  roy
 * 	91/12/15  17:08:26  pjg
 * 	Added functions to support exec().
 * 
 * 	91/10/15  16:56:14  noemi
 * 	Initial revision
 * 
 * $EndLog
